WEBVTT

00:09.509 --> 00:11.511
[suspenseful action music]

00:13.513 --> 00:14.806
-[gasps]
-Cheong-san!

00:14.889 --> 00:16.099
[screams]

00:16.182 --> 00:17.517
[Cheong-san groans]

00:19.144 --> 00:20.311
[breathes heavily]

00:20.395 --> 00:22.355
-[grumbles]
-[shrieks]

00:22.439 --> 00:23.273
[grunts]

00:23.356 --> 00:24.482
On-jo.

00:26.776 --> 00:27.777
[Su-hyeok grunts]

00:34.951 --> 00:36.786
-[grunts]
-[groans]

00:37.412 --> 00:38.538
[grunts]

00:39.497 --> 00:40.832
[Joon-yeong] Su-hyeok!

00:40.915 --> 00:42.959
-Su-hyeok, are you, are you okay?
-[groans]

00:45.295 --> 00:46.755
[breathes shakily]

00:47.964 --> 00:48.923
-[groans]
-Shit.

00:55.388 --> 00:56.681
[sighs]

00:58.975 --> 00:59.893
Who are you?

00:59.976 --> 01:02.979
What the hell are you?
You come from the One Heart club?

01:04.689 --> 01:06.649
ONE HEART

01:06.733 --> 01:07.984
It's me.

01:09.069 --> 01:10.153
Yeah.

01:11.237 --> 01:12.405
You don't know?

01:13.907 --> 01:15.784
How the fuck do you not know me?

01:15.867 --> 01:18.244
I know you. I said it many times before.

01:18.328 --> 01:19.204
[munching]

01:19.287 --> 01:20.330
You're the bullies' gopher.

01:20.413 --> 01:21.414
[grunts]

01:21.498 --> 01:23.333
[gasps]

01:23.416 --> 01:27.670
If you call me that again, I'll kill you.

01:27.754 --> 01:30.006
You weren't a gangster
and you weren't a good student.

01:30.089 --> 01:32.842
And now you're not a human
and you're not a zombie either.

01:34.427 --> 01:36.262
No matter the time or place…

01:38.181 --> 01:39.182
you're nothing.

01:41.267 --> 01:42.936
I won't just kill you.

01:45.438 --> 01:49.734
I'll gouge out both of your eyes
and feed your blind ass to the zombies.

01:49.818 --> 01:50.693
Oh, yeah.

01:53.279 --> 01:55.240
Everyone but Cheong-san, can go.

01:56.157 --> 01:57.534
Unless you wanna die with him.

02:03.957 --> 02:05.792
You're all dead.

02:05.875 --> 02:07.043
[grunts]

02:07.127 --> 02:08.086
Let's go tie him.

02:08.670 --> 02:10.004
[all grunting]

02:10.547 --> 02:11.631
[Joon-yeong] Move.

02:11.714 --> 02:13.007
[gasping]

02:13.091 --> 02:14.425
[grunts]

02:15.468 --> 02:17.137
[Joon-yeong groans]

02:17.220 --> 02:18.555
-[Gwi-nam grunts]
-[Ji-min yelps]

02:19.139 --> 02:20.473
[Wu-jin groans]

02:22.308 --> 02:23.601
[both grunting]

02:23.685 --> 02:24.894
[groans]

02:25.603 --> 02:26.729
-[thuds]
-[grunts]

02:31.901 --> 02:33.027
[screams]

02:40.952 --> 02:42.745
-[grunts]
-[growling]

02:46.666 --> 02:47.917
[bones crunching]

02:53.548 --> 02:55.508
[grunting]

02:55.592 --> 02:58.177
[bones crunching]

03:04.225 --> 03:05.059
[Nam-ra grunts]

03:10.398 --> 03:11.232
[groans]

03:15.194 --> 03:16.529
[grunts, breathes heavily]

03:17.155 --> 03:18.156
[screams]

03:28.666 --> 03:30.084
Let go.

03:30.168 --> 03:31.753
Let go!

03:36.549 --> 03:37.592
[grunting]

03:39.135 --> 03:40.094
[Nam-ra whimpers]

03:54.525 --> 03:57.278
You smell nice, huh.

03:58.947 --> 04:00.240
[both grunt]

04:02.492 --> 04:04.953
You and me are on the same side.

04:05.995 --> 04:06.955
Smell me.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.082
Yeah, come on.

04:09.165 --> 04:10.500
Fuck off.

04:11.417 --> 04:12.460
[groans]

04:14.170 --> 04:15.463
[grunts]

04:21.052 --> 04:22.470
[gasps]

04:22.553 --> 04:25.598
[both breathing heavily]

04:28.977 --> 04:30.645
[Dae-su coughing]

04:37.485 --> 04:38.611
[Wu-jin] Your shirt's ripped.

04:38.695 --> 04:39.904
It's okay, now.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.574
[Dae-su] Damn it.

04:44.242 --> 04:45.118
Ooh.

04:47.370 --> 04:48.788
[Dae-su groaning]

04:50.873 --> 04:52.875
[Dae-su] What the hell was this?

04:53.459 --> 04:54.711
He was so strong.

04:56.629 --> 04:58.339
[Hyo-ryeong] Does anything else hurt?

04:58.423 --> 04:59.882
[Dae-su] Did your glasses break?

05:01.551 --> 05:02.593
You're bleeding.

05:02.677 --> 05:04.846
-[Ji-min] So he's Gwi-nam?
-[Wu-jin] What? Damn it.

05:05.972 --> 05:07.849
-[Dae-su] What about me?
-[Wu-jin] Let me see.

05:09.225 --> 05:10.476
[Wu-jin] You're okay.

05:10.560 --> 05:11.811
[Dae-su] It hurts like hell.

05:13.813 --> 05:15.815
[theme music]

05:17.608 --> 05:19.986
[squelching]

05:31.372 --> 05:33.750
[all growling]

05:34.334 --> 05:35.710
[gasping]

05:37.295 --> 05:39.297
[ominous music]

05:40.757 --> 05:42.008
Shit!

05:43.301 --> 05:45.595
We are on the same side.

05:47.388 --> 05:48.681
[grunting]

05:54.645 --> 05:56.272
[groaning]

06:00.234 --> 06:06.407
EXAMINATION ROOM

06:06.491 --> 06:08.326
[indistinct chattering]

06:14.332 --> 06:15.875
[service worker] Here you go.

06:15.958 --> 06:16.876
Thank you.

06:19.545 --> 06:20.880
[Jae-jun gasping]

06:20.963 --> 06:22.757
[raspy breathing]

06:25.468 --> 06:26.385
[growls]

06:29.055 --> 06:30.306
[snarls]

06:34.185 --> 06:36.979
They can't find
the homologous sequence of the virus.

06:37.063 --> 06:38.231
What does that mean?

06:39.649 --> 06:41.943
All living organisms have a root system,

06:42.527 --> 06:45.488
if you follow a specific route,
you can trace it back to its origin.

06:46.155 --> 06:49.200
Sort of like a genealogy for viruses.

06:49.283 --> 06:50.993
But we can't figure it out.

06:52.370 --> 06:54.539
Are you saying it's a brand new virus?

06:54.622 --> 06:58.459
The KDCA is analyzing it too
but so far they can't identify it either.

06:59.377 --> 07:03.297
We need to identify it
so we can start creating treatments.

07:07.385 --> 07:09.220
You are supposed to be the experts.

07:09.971 --> 07:12.390
How the hell could you not
have identified it by now?

07:14.433 --> 07:15.518
It's strange.

07:16.394 --> 07:19.188
The RNA structure changes
every time we test it.

07:20.231 --> 07:23.943
It's almost like the virus
is evolving on its own.

07:30.783 --> 07:33.202
We rescued a detective
from Hyosan Police Station.

07:33.286 --> 07:35.663
And he seems to know
a lot about the virus, sir.

07:39.542 --> 07:41.627
There's a laptop
in Hyosan High School that has--

07:41.711 --> 07:43.045
Hey.

07:43.129 --> 07:45.256
You need to start from the very beginning.

07:45.339 --> 07:46.549
But we don't have much time.

07:46.632 --> 07:47.967
-[scoffs]
-[gasps]

07:49.927 --> 07:52.722
The disease spreading in Hyosan
is called the Jonas Virus.

07:52.805 --> 07:55.766
Lee Byeong-chan, a science teacher
at Hyosan High School, created it.

07:56.350 --> 07:58.603
He left his laptop
in the school science lab.

07:59.312 --> 08:02.565
He said it has everything we need in order
to get ourselves out of this catastrophe.

08:03.149 --> 08:03.983
In his computer?

08:04.609 --> 08:07.111
-Do you think his story is credible?
-Yes.

08:07.778 --> 08:09.780
The research says
the initial reports of the outbreak

08:09.864 --> 08:12.241
were from Hyosan Hospital's ER
and the high school.

08:13.075 --> 08:15.828
And says the girl that was taken
to the ER was a student there.

08:16.370 --> 08:18.498
I'm positive that Hyosan High School
was ground zero.

08:28.382 --> 08:30.551
Keep questioning the detective.

08:30.635 --> 08:32.386
Send Special Mission to the school.

08:33.596 --> 08:34.639
Retrieve the laptop.

08:35.598 --> 08:36.557
Yes, sir.

08:37.141 --> 08:39.560
[indistinct chatter]

08:43.147 --> 08:44.357
Eun-ji.

08:44.440 --> 08:45.483
Eun-ji!

08:45.566 --> 08:47.109
WAITING STATION

08:48.694 --> 08:49.737
[breathes shakily]

08:56.827 --> 08:58.996
Are you doing okay?

08:59.956 --> 09:01.832
I thought for sure you were dead.

09:01.916 --> 09:03.376
You let me go knowing I'd die.

09:04.585 --> 09:06.587
Uh, I'm sorry.

09:07.171 --> 09:08.923
-I was just--
-[Eun-ji] It's fine.

09:10.675 --> 09:12.009
That's just how you are.

09:14.095 --> 09:14.929
Hey.

09:15.721 --> 09:17.306
You wanna hear some good news?

09:17.932 --> 09:19.600
I set the school on fire.

09:20.393 --> 09:22.270
It's should be burned
to the ground by now.

09:23.437 --> 09:25.356
You set fire to the school?

09:25.940 --> 09:27.984
Yeah. It's great, right?

09:29.527 --> 09:30.736
Are you all right?

09:32.488 --> 09:33.573
I'm doing okay.

09:34.490 --> 09:35.324
Why?

09:36.325 --> 09:38.578
You don't seem like yourself.

09:41.038 --> 09:42.206
I'm hungry.

09:43.207 --> 09:44.875
And I get worked up when I'm hungry.

09:47.837 --> 09:49.922
Do you want this then?

09:50.006 --> 09:52.466
They're giving them out
but the line's crazy long.

09:53.050 --> 09:54.510
You should eat first.

09:55.303 --> 09:56.637
No, I don't want that.

09:58.139 --> 10:00.266
But I think this is all they have.

10:00.349 --> 10:03.269
I don't want that. I want something else.

10:04.812 --> 10:05.688
Like what?

10:06.981 --> 10:07.982
Mmm…

10:10.484 --> 10:11.319
You?

10:12.194 --> 10:13.029
Me?

10:15.197 --> 10:16.073
Yeah.

10:16.699 --> 10:17.950
I wanna eat you.

10:24.582 --> 10:25.625
[sighs]

10:26.500 --> 10:27.752
[groans]

10:28.961 --> 10:31.005
[Dae-su] Damn, it stings.

10:31.881 --> 10:32.882
[groans]

10:34.133 --> 10:36.844
What the hell is with that Gwi-nam kid?

10:38.095 --> 10:39.263
You said he got bitten.

10:41.474 --> 10:42.308
I don't know.

10:43.017 --> 10:45.478
It looks like he became
something totally different.

10:45.561 --> 10:47.063
I don't think he can die.

10:47.146 --> 10:48.731
What if he climbs back up here?

10:51.525 --> 10:52.777
He's bad enough…

10:54.528 --> 10:56.614
but to be honest,
I'm scared of Nam-ra too.

10:57.281 --> 10:58.699
You saw her fighting before.

10:59.700 --> 11:00.576
Well…

11:01.410 --> 11:03.996
I think it's reasonable to assume
they're both half-bies--

11:05.414 --> 11:06.707
What?

11:08.793 --> 11:10.503
Are you really okay, Nam-ra?

11:12.546 --> 11:13.798
You won't do that to us, right?

11:16.217 --> 11:18.594
Would you believe me
if I said that I wouldn't?

11:19.345 --> 11:20.846
Why do you have to say it that way?

11:22.014 --> 11:23.682
Can you at least try
to make us believe you?

11:26.227 --> 11:28.187
We're going to be together anyway.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.563
[fire crackling]

11:34.819 --> 11:35.694
[sighs]

11:37.947 --> 11:39.073
[breathes deeply]

11:40.157 --> 11:41.075
I…

11:42.451 --> 11:44.829
I've never done anything but study.

11:46.997 --> 11:50.376
I don't think I was naive,
I think I was a coward.

11:52.086 --> 11:55.089
I was too scared my grades would drop
and my mom would get mad.

11:55.172 --> 11:56.632
So I didn't do anything.

11:57.591 --> 11:59.635
I was too scared to make friends.

12:01.429 --> 12:05.683
My mom would always ask me
what rank they were in class,

12:05.766 --> 12:08.352
what their parents did,
how big their house was…

12:10.020 --> 12:11.105
[wood clanks]

12:13.107 --> 12:14.525
[fire cracking]

12:16.235 --> 12:17.862
I never thought I'd get a chance

12:17.945 --> 12:20.656
to sit around a fire
with all of you like this.

12:25.286 --> 12:27.288
It's really nice.

12:29.123 --> 12:30.374
It's my first time.

12:33.085 --> 12:35.004
If we somehow manage to get out of here.

12:35.713 --> 12:37.423
I really hope we could make a fire…

12:38.257 --> 12:39.717
and hang out like this again.

12:43.012 --> 12:45.764
I really hope we can do that.

12:47.808 --> 12:49.143
Sure, let's do it.

12:51.020 --> 12:53.439
If anyone wants to make a fire…

12:56.150 --> 12:57.985
we can all get together.

13:01.405 --> 13:03.532
Sorry, Nam-ra.

13:06.160 --> 13:07.036
[chuckles softly]

13:08.037 --> 13:10.873
Ooh. Did you just smile?

13:10.956 --> 13:12.541
Super awkward.
[chuckles]

13:13.167 --> 13:15.794
God, come on.

13:15.878 --> 13:17.463
What now? What?

13:18.047 --> 13:19.673
Why don't you two just date already?

13:19.757 --> 13:21.050
You guys are so annoying.

13:21.133 --> 13:22.218
-Are you crazy?
-Psycho.

13:22.760 --> 13:23.594
[hisses in distance]

13:23.677 --> 13:24.553
[Nam-ra] Hold on.

13:24.637 --> 13:25.888
[Dae-su gasps]

13:27.348 --> 13:28.641
Did you hear that?

13:29.225 --> 13:30.059
No, what is it?

13:30.142 --> 13:32.436
What? Is someone out there?

13:37.525 --> 13:38.359
Listen.

13:39.026 --> 13:40.736
-[gasps]
-Huh?

13:43.364 --> 13:45.533
-[Hyo-ryeong] What's happening?
-[breathes nervously]

13:48.702 --> 13:49.787
What is it?

13:52.790 --> 13:54.124
I don't see anything.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.545
[helicopter whirring in distance]

13:58.379 --> 13:59.630
Hold on.

13:59.713 --> 14:00.839
I hear a helicopter.

14:00.923 --> 14:02.925
[suspenseful music]

14:03.759 --> 14:05.302
[helicopter whirring in distance]

14:15.521 --> 14:19.149
[pilot] Command, do you copy?
We've entered Hyosan airspace.

14:19.233 --> 14:21.277
Approaching the school from the west.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.236
[Cheong-san] Hey.

14:23.028 --> 14:24.697
-[Cheong-san] Fire!
-[Wu-jin] Yeah, yeah. They see us.

14:24.780 --> 14:26.198
-[Wu-jin] They're coming.
-[Dae-su] This way. It's this way.

14:26.282 --> 14:27.408
-Hey, right here!
-Here, here!

14:27.491 --> 14:29.285
-Here. Hey, hey!
-Over here!

14:29.368 --> 14:31.829
-Come on!
-Please help!

14:31.912 --> 14:34.331
-Over here! Come on!
-Hey! Over here!

14:34.415 --> 14:36.000
-We're here!
-Here!

14:36.083 --> 14:38.043
-This way. This way. Look over here.
-Look at us, will you?

14:38.127 --> 14:39.169
-Come save us!
-Here!

14:39.253 --> 14:40.671
-Come save us.
-Can't you see us?

14:40.754 --> 14:42.590
-We're here!
-Over here!

14:42.673 --> 14:43.674
-Right here!
-Here!

14:43.757 --> 14:45.009
-Hey!
-Look at us!

14:45.092 --> 14:46.969
-Here! Help!
-Over here!

14:48.262 --> 14:51.390
[pilot] We've entered the airspace
above Hyosan High School.

14:51.473 --> 14:52.850
Ready for landing.

14:57.354 --> 15:00.316
-Down here!
-Here! Over here!

15:00.399 --> 15:02.109
-Over here!
-Come on!

15:02.192 --> 15:04.987
-Hey!
-Over here! Right here!

15:07.323 --> 15:09.074
[clamoring]

15:10.117 --> 15:11.869
-Hey!
-Hey, over here!

15:11.952 --> 15:14.246
[cheering, clamoring]

15:16.332 --> 15:17.333
-[laughing]
-[cheering]

15:17.416 --> 15:18.542
[grunting]

15:18.626 --> 15:20.336
[laughing]

15:20.419 --> 15:22.504
Over here! Over here!

15:22.588 --> 15:24.381
[cheering]

15:26.383 --> 15:27.760
[wind howling]

15:35.893 --> 15:37.895
[suspenseful music]

15:47.363 --> 15:49.031
-Hey, hey.
-Whoa!

15:51.784 --> 15:53.077
[helicopter whirring]

16:00.042 --> 16:01.085
[soldier 1] Get down.

16:01.877 --> 16:02.711
All of you.

16:04.797 --> 16:05.631
Sir.

16:06.298 --> 16:07.257
Can you please help us?

16:07.341 --> 16:10.594
Face down on the ground! Get down!

16:14.348 --> 16:16.058
[soldier 1] Clear the area. Over.

16:17.184 --> 16:18.352
High school roof.

16:18.936 --> 16:20.646
Nine survivors confirmed.

16:21.438 --> 16:22.272
Their condition?

16:22.940 --> 16:24.566
[soldier 1] Checking temperatures now.

16:24.650 --> 16:26.568
-[thermal scanner beeps]
-[soldier 2] Clear.

16:26.652 --> 16:28.404
I think they're checking if we're zombies.

16:28.487 --> 16:29.905
-[soldier 2] Clear.
-Don't worry.

16:29.989 --> 16:30.823
[soldier 3] Clear.

16:30.906 --> 16:32.533
-[thermal scanner beeps]
-[soldier 4] Clear.

16:36.078 --> 16:37.746
-[thermal scanner beeps]
-[soldier 4] Clear.

16:38.539 --> 16:40.416
-[thermal scanner beeps]
-[soldier 3] Clear.

16:44.128 --> 16:45.879
-[thermal scanner beeps]
-[soldier 4] Clear.

16:53.595 --> 16:54.555
[thermal scanner beeps]

16:55.556 --> 16:56.807
[soldier 4] Temperature is 34.5.

16:58.392 --> 17:00.060
Providing a warming blanket.

17:05.441 --> 17:08.152
[soldier 1] One has hypothermia.
The rest are normal.

17:09.862 --> 17:11.739
Rescue them after you complete
the objective.

17:12.322 --> 17:14.366
We'll rescue after
the mission's complete. Over.

17:15.576 --> 17:17.828
It's okay. They're gonna rescue us.

17:18.787 --> 17:19.663
It's over now.

17:21.498 --> 17:23.417
[soldiers 1] You can get up now.

17:27.504 --> 17:28.922
Are you the only survivors?

17:29.006 --> 17:30.424
We don't really know.

17:31.175 --> 17:32.760
There are probably others.

17:32.843 --> 17:34.678
[soldier 1] We're going down
for a few minutes.

17:34.762 --> 17:35.971
Wait right here.

17:36.055 --> 17:37.765
Aren't you not gonna rescue us?

17:37.848 --> 17:38.974
[soldier 1] Yes, we will.

17:39.516 --> 17:40.809
So don't go anywhere.

17:40.893 --> 17:42.561
Don't do anything. Just wait here.

17:42.644 --> 17:44.271
-[soldier 1] Understand?
-[students] Mm-hm. Yes.

17:44.354 --> 17:45.230
[soldier 1] Let's go.

18:00.162 --> 18:01.789
[soldier 1] Three men, standing by.

18:01.872 --> 18:02.790
Chopper, report.

18:05.250 --> 18:07.252
[suspenseful action music]

18:13.258 --> 18:14.176
[pilot] Copy that.

18:15.385 --> 18:17.846
Inbound. Spotlight hot.

18:19.181 --> 18:20.974
[soldier 1] Roger that.
We're all set. Over.

18:21.058 --> 18:22.309
HYOSAN HIGH SCHOOL

18:22.392 --> 18:23.560
[Mi-jin] Let's just go.

18:23.644 --> 18:25.354
The zombies went toward the chopper.

18:25.437 --> 18:26.814
Let's just get up to the roof, okay?

18:28.398 --> 18:30.400
[helicopter whirring in distance]

18:36.865 --> 18:37.699
Let's go.

18:42.579 --> 18:43.413
How about him?

18:48.210 --> 18:49.419
We bring him.

18:51.672 --> 18:53.257
[glass window shatters]

18:54.299 --> 18:55.467
[zombies growling]

18:55.551 --> 18:57.344
-[gunfire]
-[zombies growling]

18:57.427 --> 18:58.470
[zombies growling]

18:59.179 --> 19:01.140
[gunfire continues]

19:05.811 --> 19:07.146
-[gunfire]
-[zombies growling]

19:09.022 --> 19:10.357
[zombies growling]

19:12.401 --> 19:14.069
[gunfire continues]

19:23.579 --> 19:25.747
-[gunfire in distance]
-[zombies growling]

19:33.088 --> 19:34.840
-[Joon-seong groans]
-Be gentle.

19:34.923 --> 19:36.049
-[Min-jae] So, slower.
-[Joon-seong] Seriously.

19:36.133 --> 19:38.135
-[Mi-jin] How's that? Comfy?
-[Joon-seong] It's good.

19:38.218 --> 19:39.761
Don't put any straps…
[groans]

19:39.845 --> 19:41.597
-…on my stomach.
-Okay, don't worry.

19:43.765 --> 19:45.142
-[gunfire]
-[zombies growling]

19:46.393 --> 19:49.813
[soldier 1] The infected are converging
on the field and the front gate.

19:50.355 --> 19:51.940
What's your status? Do you copy?

19:52.983 --> 19:55.110
[both] We're clear. Moving in.

19:57.070 --> 19:59.907
[breathes heavily]

20:04.828 --> 20:06.830
[soldier 1] Report. What's the situation?

20:07.331 --> 20:09.625
[gunfire in distance]

20:12.711 --> 20:13.545
Hey.

20:14.129 --> 20:16.882
Are they gonna kill all the zombies
before they take us?

20:16.965 --> 20:19.134
I don't think so.
There's only four of them.

20:20.385 --> 20:22.095
But they're Special Mission, right?

20:23.597 --> 20:24.932
Are they looking for something?

20:26.350 --> 20:28.393
Are they heading to the science lab?

20:28.477 --> 20:30.479
[suspenseful music]

20:36.026 --> 20:38.695
-[soldier 4] We're in.
-[soldier 1] Do you have the package?

20:38.779 --> 20:40.072
[soldier 4] Checking now.

20:41.823 --> 20:43.116
[gunfire]

20:46.578 --> 20:49.790
[pilot] The infected are getting
in your position. Do you read?

20:49.873 --> 20:51.166
Prepare for extraction.

20:52.334 --> 20:54.753
[soldier 4] I still don't have the file.
Unlocking device.

20:54.836 --> 20:57.005
[soldier 1] We have to get out.
Speed it up.

20:57.798 --> 20:59.341
DECRYPTION COMPLETE, SUCCESS

20:59.424 --> 21:01.176
[soldier 4] File obtained. Heading out.

21:07.557 --> 21:08.976
[zombies growling]

21:09.059 --> 21:10.978
[gunfire]

21:15.565 --> 21:16.733
[soldier 4] Moving out!

21:17.442 --> 21:18.485
[gunfire continues]

21:19.111 --> 21:20.570
[panting]

21:21.613 --> 21:24.449
[soldier 1] Report your evac status
and the situation in the school.

21:26.326 --> 21:28.745
[soldier 4] The infected
are moving quickly to the science lab.

21:29.579 --> 21:31.540
Rescue the students and return to base.

21:32.207 --> 21:33.125
[soldier 1] Yes, sir.

21:34.835 --> 21:36.295
Commander…
[panting]

21:36.378 --> 21:37.671
…we had an incident
in the quarantine camp.

21:37.754 --> 21:39.089
What is it? What happened?

21:39.172 --> 21:41.633
-Connect monitor 34.
-[military officer 1] Yes, sir.

21:42.384 --> 21:44.386
[foreboding music]

21:46.388 --> 21:48.140
Rewind about ten minutes.

21:48.223 --> 21:50.726
[helicopter whirring]

21:51.977 --> 21:53.437
[soldier 1] Where's the package?

21:58.608 --> 22:00.986
-[soldier 1] Ready for extraction.
-[pilot] Coming down. Over.

22:05.324 --> 22:07.367
[soldier 1] Master Sergeant.
You go up first.

22:07.451 --> 22:08.368
[soldier 2] Yes, sir.

22:08.994 --> 22:10.871
[soldier 1] We'll pull you up
one at a time.

22:10.954 --> 22:12.372
Stay still even if you're scared.

22:12.956 --> 22:15.292
-Okay?
-You're not landing the chopper?

22:15.375 --> 22:19.504
We can't. It can get unstable.
He's gonna pull you up, so don't worry.

22:30.390 --> 22:33.268
[soldier 1] You can't go all at once,
so let's go one by one.

22:33.351 --> 22:34.436
We can't all go?

22:34.519 --> 22:37.397
[soldier 1] We can take all of you,
but it has to be one by one.

22:37.481 --> 22:38.648
[wind howling]

22:39.608 --> 22:43.320
-Ji-min. You go first.
-You go first. Go first.

22:46.406 --> 22:47.532
You go first.

22:57.876 --> 22:59.878
[foreboding music]

23:02.130 --> 23:03.799
[crowd clamoring]

23:03.882 --> 23:04.716
[soldier 5] Grab her!

23:05.842 --> 23:06.676
[soldier 5] Back off!

23:06.760 --> 23:08.428
-[soldier 5] Calm down!
-[growling]

23:08.512 --> 23:09.679
[whimpering]

23:09.763 --> 23:11.431
[growling, grunting]

23:13.141 --> 23:14.434
[groans]

23:18.188 --> 23:19.815
[crowd clamoring]

23:22.692 --> 23:23.860
[grunting]

23:26.822 --> 23:28.448
[soldier 5] Stop! Calm down, calm down!

23:34.996 --> 23:36.081
What the hell is that?

23:37.791 --> 23:40.210
I believe she's infected but asymptomatic.

23:44.881 --> 23:46.675
So she has a disease but…

23:47.300 --> 23:49.302
there was no way to tell she was infected?

23:51.888 --> 23:53.890
[suspenseful music]

24:00.438 --> 24:02.399
-[wind howling]
-[helicopter hovering]

24:09.281 --> 24:10.740
[whirring]

24:18.206 --> 24:20.292
You're saying
we can't differentiate between

24:21.334 --> 24:22.460
the healthy and the infected?

24:24.129 --> 24:25.964
[military officer 2]
Connect to the team at Hyosan High!

24:26.047 --> 24:29.050
-[military officer 1] Yes, sir.
-[military officer 2] Where's team bravo?

24:30.385 --> 24:31.595
Don't rescue anyone.

24:32.512 --> 24:34.639
[soldier 1] Say again.
Did you mean everyone?

24:34.723 --> 24:37.184
We just discovered a case as asymptomatic.

24:37.267 --> 24:38.768
[soldier 1] But their temperatures
are fine.

24:38.852 --> 24:41.521
It was the same thing
with the girl we brought here.

24:41.605 --> 24:43.815
[Seon-moo] No one will be safe if one
of them gets sick in the chopper.

24:43.899 --> 24:46.151
If they resist… shoot them.

24:46.735 --> 24:48.069
[soldier 1] They're just children.

24:48.153 --> 24:50.614
[Seon-moo] Listen to me.
Soldiers are dying here!

24:50.697 --> 24:53.408
Four men were attacked by one girl!
So do as I say.

24:55.076 --> 24:57.078
[soldier 1] Understood. Over.

24:57.162 --> 24:58.955
[machine whirring]

24:59.039 --> 25:00.790
Cancel the operation.

25:00.874 --> 25:03.168
We'll take just the package and pull out!

25:04.377 --> 25:06.630
-Darn it!
-I think I'm going back down.

25:06.713 --> 25:08.381
-Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hey.
-[Ji-min] I'm coming down.

25:08.465 --> 25:09.591
Wait a second.

25:09.674 --> 25:11.927
-[Wu-jin] She's coming down!
-[Dae-su] She's-- she's coming down!

25:12.010 --> 25:13.136
-Why is she coming down?
-What's wrong?

25:13.220 --> 25:14.763
-What's going on?
-I don't know!

25:14.846 --> 25:17.474
Why did you take that off?
Wait a minute. What?

25:20.810 --> 25:23.772
-[Wu-jin] What operation is this?
-What are you doing? What is this?

25:23.855 --> 25:25.023
Please just pull me back up.

25:25.106 --> 25:27.525
Pull me back up! God, damn it!
I'm not going back.

25:27.609 --> 25:29.861
I'm not going. I'm not going.

25:29.945 --> 25:32.572
Take me with you! I'm not going.
Sir. Please.

25:32.656 --> 25:34.741
[whimpering]
I wanna get out of here!

25:35.408 --> 25:36.910
Please, take me with you!

25:38.828 --> 25:40.288
[Dae-su] Come on, sir!

25:40.372 --> 25:41.498
[spluttering]
W-- Wait a second.

25:41.581 --> 25:44.042
What's wrong with you? We're fine.

25:44.125 --> 25:45.377
We're not zombies.

25:45.460 --> 25:47.879
Go ahead. Shoot.

25:47.963 --> 25:49.339
Please, just take me with you!

25:49.422 --> 25:51.508
-[soldier 1] Stand back.
-[clamoring]

25:51.591 --> 25:52.759
Stand back, or we'll shoot.

25:53.260 --> 25:54.261
Stand back!

25:55.136 --> 25:56.805
All right team, get in the chopper.

25:57.305 --> 25:58.390
I said shoot.

26:00.433 --> 26:04.145
[Seon-moo] Do you not hear me?
Shoot them. That's an order!

26:04.229 --> 26:06.815
Wait a minute.
You can't even take a few of us with you?

26:06.898 --> 26:09.067
Shoot, you bastard. Shoot them now!

26:09.651 --> 26:10.944
-[gunfire]
-[screaming, clamoring]

26:13.071 --> 26:14.656
[Joon-seong groaning]

26:17.993 --> 26:19.995
-[Joon-seong groaning]
-[Mi-jin] Be quiet.

26:22.622 --> 26:24.624
[foreboding music]

26:25.750 --> 26:26.710
[Joon-seong groans]

26:26.793 --> 26:28.670
-[Mi-jin] Quiet down.
-[Min-jae] Damn it.

26:30.964 --> 26:32.090
To the roof, right?

26:32.799 --> 26:34.092
You think we'll make it?

26:34.175 --> 26:37.178
We won't get up there in time.
Let's just try this building.

26:37.262 --> 26:38.555
[exhales sharply]
Let's go.

26:39.097 --> 26:40.140
Wrong way.

26:40.223 --> 26:43.435
-What? Okay. Let's go.
-Hey. Help me out.

26:43.518 --> 26:44.769
Oh, shit.

26:46.104 --> 26:49.024
I'm begging.
Please take just a few of us with you.

26:50.025 --> 26:51.609
[wind howling]

26:53.194 --> 26:54.404
[breathes heavily]

26:57.407 --> 26:58.700
[gunfire]

26:58.783 --> 27:00.035
-[screaming]
-[cocks gun]

27:04.664 --> 27:05.832
Rescue us.

27:13.340 --> 27:14.382
[soldier 1] I'm sorry.

27:18.762 --> 27:20.764
[unsettling music]

27:27.687 --> 27:30.065
[machine whirring]

27:31.649 --> 27:33.443
[wind howling]

27:48.792 --> 27:51.419
We have the package.
All agents pulling out.

27:51.503 --> 27:52.545
Return to the base.

27:57.092 --> 27:57.967
[helicopter whirring]

28:09.521 --> 28:10.814
[grumbles]

28:23.701 --> 28:25.703
[ominous music]

28:30.959 --> 28:32.085
[zombie growling]

28:33.086 --> 28:34.462
[panting]

28:36.131 --> 28:38.341
Hey. Why is it coming this way?

28:38.425 --> 28:39.426
Did you think they saw us?

28:42.512 --> 28:44.472
[helicopter whirring]

28:44.556 --> 28:46.099
[growling]

28:54.482 --> 28:57.485
Over here! Here! Look! Over here!

28:58.278 --> 29:00.071
Look, right here!

29:01.239 --> 29:03.199
[sighs, pants]

29:03.283 --> 29:04.325
[Mi-jin] Shit.

29:05.744 --> 29:06.995
[zombie growling]

29:07.078 --> 29:08.455
Oh, we're screwed. Shit!

29:08.538 --> 29:10.039
-Run! Run, run!
-Oh, shit.

29:10.123 --> 29:11.833
[zombie growls]

29:12.417 --> 29:13.835
[Hyo-ryeong sobs]

29:22.969 --> 29:24.262
They abandoned us.

29:24.345 --> 29:25.972
[Hyo-ryeong whimpering]
Didn't they?

29:26.973 --> 29:29.184
No one's come to save us now?

29:29.267 --> 29:30.894
[crying]

29:31.561 --> 29:33.104
But why did they do that?

29:33.897 --> 29:34.898
Maybe…

29:36.065 --> 29:38.401
they thought that all of us
were already fucking zombies.

29:39.277 --> 29:40.820
They would have killed us.

29:41.946 --> 29:43.490
They wouldn't have left us…

29:44.449 --> 29:46.326
here alive if they thought that.

29:50.538 --> 29:52.081
[grunting]

29:55.251 --> 29:56.169
What are you doing?

29:56.252 --> 29:57.796
[both panting]

29:57.879 --> 29:59.047
It's pointless.

30:00.006 --> 30:02.717
No one's coming. No one else is coming.

30:03.343 --> 30:04.344
-[grunts]
-[wood clatters]

30:09.516 --> 30:10.850
[Cheong-san screams]

30:10.934 --> 30:11.768
[breathes heavily]

30:13.061 --> 30:14.229
[door opens]

30:27.951 --> 30:28.827
[door closes]

30:28.910 --> 30:32.080
[investigator] A witness stated that you
and your aide were accomplices

30:32.163 --> 30:36.793
in Kim U-sin and Nam So-ju's escape
and result in an attack on our men.

30:38.294 --> 30:39.921
He kept denying your involvement

30:40.004 --> 30:43.049
so we asked you to come here
and answer some questions.

30:47.220 --> 30:48.763
Are you recording this?

30:48.847 --> 30:51.015
-[investigator] Yes, we are.
-[Dal-ho] Wait a minute.

30:51.099 --> 30:54.018
Aren't you supposed to tell us
if you're gonna record the investigation?

30:54.102 --> 30:57.397
[investigator] We're gonna record
this conversation. Give your consent.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.774
Would you please point
the camera at me directly?

31:00.817 --> 31:01.943
[investigator] Go ahead.

31:04.821 --> 31:05.822
[camera whirring]

31:07.073 --> 31:08.157
Is it set?

31:08.241 --> 31:09.325
[military police] Yes.

31:12.787 --> 31:13.621
[sighs]

31:15.039 --> 31:17.542
I'm Assemblywoman Park Eun-hee.

31:17.625 --> 31:22.547
I've been accused of aiding and abetting
firefighters Nam So-ju and Kim U-sin,

31:22.630 --> 31:25.258
who had saved my life,
and their escape from the camp.

31:25.341 --> 31:26.843
I am being interrogated.

31:27.510 --> 31:30.680
But I was not an accomplice.

31:32.098 --> 31:33.892
I was the true offender.

31:35.018 --> 31:36.477
Ma'am, are you kidding me?

31:36.561 --> 31:38.396
That's not true. Stop recording, huh!

31:38.980 --> 31:39.856
Stay back.

31:41.608 --> 31:43.943
I don't understand why you're doing this?

31:44.027 --> 31:45.111
What are you doing ma'am?

31:52.243 --> 31:53.578
Do whatever you think is best.

31:54.495 --> 31:56.039
I won't get involved anymore.

32:01.461 --> 32:05.298
Firefighter Nam So-ju saved us,
and he did this despite the fact

32:05.381 --> 32:06.925
that his daughter was nearby.

32:07.926 --> 32:11.638
He tried to go save his daughter
after he saved us

32:11.721 --> 32:13.932
but The Martial Law Units stopped him.

32:15.516 --> 32:17.685
His daughter was everything to him.

32:18.728 --> 32:20.688
I said I'd take responsibility,

32:21.272 --> 32:24.859
and that he should escape by any means
necessary to save his daughter.

32:26.277 --> 32:28.529
Even if it's not allowed
under martial law,

32:29.739 --> 32:32.951
no one can ever stop
a father's love for his daughter.

32:34.702 --> 32:38.122
Regardless of the punishment
imposed on me…

32:39.749 --> 32:41.793
I will always stand with…

32:42.752 --> 32:44.462
the powerless citizens.

32:50.718 --> 32:52.512
[panting]

32:59.227 --> 33:00.061
[gasps]

33:01.729 --> 33:03.272
[zombie growling in distance]

33:11.531 --> 33:13.074
[growling]

33:17.203 --> 33:18.913
[thunder cracks]

33:19.747 --> 33:21.124
On-jo.

33:21.207 --> 33:22.083
Hey, Dad.

33:29.674 --> 33:30.508
[sniffles]

33:34.679 --> 33:35.596
[gasps]

33:37.932 --> 33:38.975
Please help us.

33:43.646 --> 33:45.273
My wife and baby…

33:45.356 --> 33:46.357
[shushes]

33:47.608 --> 33:49.152
[hissing]

34:01.581 --> 34:02.874
[croaks]

34:09.005 --> 34:11.049
-[breathes heavily]
-[whimpers]

34:14.469 --> 34:16.054
I can't do it alone.

34:16.137 --> 34:19.140
We need equipment
in order to cut through the frame.

34:19.223 --> 34:20.308
[shuddering]

34:20.391 --> 34:21.809
Please. Please help us.

34:21.893 --> 34:23.102
I'm sorry.

34:24.312 --> 34:26.397
I need to go find my daughter now.

34:26.898 --> 34:27.899
I'm really sorry.

34:27.982 --> 34:30.568
[sobbing]
Please, sir. I'm begging you.

34:30.651 --> 34:32.111
[sobbing]

34:32.195 --> 34:33.488
Our baby…

34:34.530 --> 34:36.407
Please, sir. Save them.

34:37.408 --> 34:38.451
Please, sir.

34:40.369 --> 34:43.122
Listen to me.
They'll start sending rescuers soon.

34:43.206 --> 34:44.665
You have to hang in there until then.

34:44.749 --> 34:46.834
But those monsters,
they could have come first.

34:47.585 --> 34:48.961
[car hissing]

34:51.798 --> 34:52.632
Shit.

34:54.634 --> 34:56.052
[sniffles, cries]

34:57.678 --> 34:58.846
[shuddering]

35:01.432 --> 35:02.517
Here.

35:04.393 --> 35:05.895
Here. Take this.

35:07.188 --> 35:08.856
You have to hang in there. You understand?

35:10.233 --> 35:11.359
[man sobbing]

35:15.071 --> 35:16.155
[cocks gun]

35:16.239 --> 35:18.241
[ominous music]

35:20.076 --> 35:21.577
[man] You have to help me.

35:23.204 --> 35:24.413
Get back here.

35:25.373 --> 35:26.249
Right now.

35:28.709 --> 35:30.378
[Byeong-chan] There's no more hope left.

35:32.255 --> 35:35.800
It's like every sin entered the human body
in concentrated form.

35:36.384 --> 35:38.302
Even if we can conquer this virus,

35:38.970 --> 35:42.473
I worried that a world ruled by humanity
will never return.

35:43.224 --> 35:45.393
Can we still believe people are beautiful

35:46.435 --> 35:49.105
after seeing them
become the worst possible creatures?

35:49.730 --> 35:51.107
If you shoot me now,

35:51.607 --> 35:53.192
they'll come running right away.

35:53.276 --> 35:55.111
We're gonna die anyway.

35:56.362 --> 35:58.114
Whether I do or I don't.

36:00.366 --> 36:01.784
My daughter is waiting for me.

36:02.285 --> 36:03.661
[sobs]

36:07.039 --> 36:09.500
I'm begging you…
[crying]

36:11.419 --> 36:13.045
Please don't go.

36:14.755 --> 36:18.301
[thunder rumbles]

36:18.384 --> 36:19.427
Don't go.

36:22.471 --> 36:24.098
[Byeong-chan] There was something we'd say

36:25.099 --> 36:28.477
at the pharmaceutical company
whenever we hit a wall.

36:30.062 --> 36:33.566
"Science begins with imagination
and ends as a mystery."

36:36.694 --> 36:38.654
I went to see a shaman on my way home.

36:44.243 --> 36:45.161
[zombie growling]

36:47.288 --> 36:50.249
He told me this right here
would immediately fix everything.

36:54.086 --> 36:55.171
[sobbing]

36:55.254 --> 36:58.299
[Eun-ji sobbing]
Please help me. Help me!

36:58.382 --> 37:00.801
[crying]
I'm human.

37:00.885 --> 37:02.511
I'm not a zombie!

37:03.596 --> 37:05.181
[whimpering]

37:07.183 --> 37:08.684
You idiot.

37:08.768 --> 37:10.228
[bottles clink]

37:11.938 --> 37:13.231
[whimpers]

37:15.441 --> 37:18.569
She's either positive or negative
depending on when we test her.

37:19.445 --> 37:20.571
What does that mean?

37:20.655 --> 37:23.616
We have to assume it's a fusion
or some kind of evolution.

37:25.159 --> 37:26.410
Like a mutation?

37:26.953 --> 37:28.329
Yes, that's correct.

37:29.497 --> 37:32.041
The virus is hiding
in the RNA of the cells.

37:32.124 --> 37:34.043
We can only detect it when it manifests.

37:34.126 --> 37:35.503
If it's dormant, it won't show up.

37:37.838 --> 37:42.051
That means tests don't tell us
whether or not the subject is infected.

37:42.134 --> 37:43.010
That's right.

37:43.761 --> 37:46.222
It's like the human and the monster
are fighting inside the patient.

37:48.933 --> 37:50.518
Is it at all possible…

37:51.477 --> 37:53.104
that there are others like her?

37:54.063 --> 37:55.189
[breathes deeply]

37:56.732 --> 37:58.859
As per KDCA's recommendation,

37:59.944 --> 38:01.237
it's best to presume

38:01.779 --> 38:04.657
that they're infected
even if they show no symptoms.

38:07.410 --> 38:09.412
[foreboding music]

38:13.624 --> 38:14.917
Going forward,

38:15.668 --> 38:17.211
separate everyone from Hyosan

38:17.295 --> 38:19.755
and considered them infected
but asymptomatic.

38:20.256 --> 38:24.468
And monitor later rescues
separately and more closely.

38:25.094 --> 38:26.762
[laughing]

38:26.846 --> 38:28.472
-Oh, I know.
-[Dal-ho laughs]

38:29.056 --> 38:30.933
Yeah. You really are amazing.

38:33.269 --> 38:34.854
To use us in that situation.

38:36.564 --> 38:39.400
She didn't use you at all
she just made the best of the situation.

38:40.067 --> 38:42.278
[Eun-hee] When it rains,
you set up your barrels.

38:42.361 --> 38:45.197
And when it's windy,
you set up the turbine, right?

38:45.281 --> 38:46.490
That's politics.

38:46.574 --> 38:50.119
You'll use that video
for your campaign, won't you?

38:51.579 --> 38:54.957
Even though you didn't save anyone,
you'll get lots of votes

38:55.583 --> 38:57.460
like you did something huge.

38:58.044 --> 38:59.253
Hey, she did.

39:00.296 --> 39:03.841
She took full responsibility
just to get you out of this mess, okay?

39:06.886 --> 39:10.056
She never told our captain
he should try to run and escape.

39:11.891 --> 39:14.477
[sighs]
Listen, U-sin.

39:14.560 --> 39:15.561
[sighs]

39:15.644 --> 39:18.898
Disasters usually create heroes. Huh?

39:18.981 --> 39:20.649
Whether or not he saves his daughter,

39:21.484 --> 39:23.819
Mr. Nam will come out of this a hero.

39:23.903 --> 39:27.323
That's what we're gonna be
working on right now.

39:28.491 --> 39:30.659
Don't you want your captain to be a hero?

39:31.410 --> 39:33.662
-That's not what I--
-And we're all on the same page.

39:33.746 --> 39:36.040
Let's look at the big picture here.

39:37.083 --> 39:39.877
From this moment on,
we are on the same team.

39:40.836 --> 39:43.714
We just have to stick together.

39:43.798 --> 39:45.299
[door creaks open]

39:46.675 --> 39:47.676
[Dal-ho] What the hell?

39:47.760 --> 39:49.303
[soldier 6] In the interest
of stopping this spread,

39:49.387 --> 39:51.180
we're taking you to a special quarantine.

39:51.263 --> 39:54.225
For safety reasons,
you'll be handcuffed during transport.

39:54.308 --> 39:55.601
Do we look like criminals to you?

39:56.102 --> 39:58.020
Why are you suddenly
imprisoning all of us?

39:58.104 --> 40:01.315
Also, how dare you try to put handcuffs
on an assemblywoman, huh?

40:01.399 --> 40:03.150
[soldier 6] Please obey the rules.

40:04.151 --> 40:05.111
[sighs]

40:05.986 --> 40:07.446
Don't test my patience.

40:07.530 --> 40:08.823
It's martial law,

40:08.906 --> 40:11.450
-not a military dictatorship.
-[soldier 7] Please obey the rules.

40:11.534 --> 40:14.995
Listen, we won't follow
unprincipled rules.

40:15.079 --> 40:19.166
Kill me first
if you're gonna take her away, huh!

40:19.250 --> 40:21.627
-Come on. Make a shield.
-Yes, sir.

40:21.710 --> 40:23.087
Hold on.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.049
[cock guns]

40:29.260 --> 40:30.261
Make a shield.

40:34.640 --> 40:35.516
[grumbles]

40:37.309 --> 40:39.311
[foreboding music]

40:42.064 --> 40:44.692
[male announcer on PA] Attention,
all citizens in the quarantine camp.

40:44.775 --> 40:47.194
In order to find those who are infected
but asymptomatic,

40:47.278 --> 40:50.489
we are separating Hyosan citizens
from those of you from other regions,

40:50.573 --> 40:53.701
as per the KDCA's recent
safety recommendation.

40:54.952 --> 40:56.370
I'm fine. It's okay.

40:57.121 --> 40:58.456
[scoffs]

40:58.539 --> 41:00.624
[male announcer on PA]
Until a reliable testing method is created

41:00.708 --> 41:02.293
and the situation is resolved,

41:02.376 --> 41:07.256
stricter quarantine rules will be put
in place effective immediately.

41:07.339 --> 41:10.301
We apologize for the inconvenience
and encouraging to cooperate.

41:11.135 --> 41:12.219
[Ho-cheol grumbles]

41:12.720 --> 41:15.264
What the hell's happening?
You said we'd be treated like heroes.

41:15.347 --> 41:16.557
You shut up for once.

41:17.308 --> 41:19.226
Did you find the laptop? What happened?

41:20.311 --> 41:22.730
[soldier 8] Come on, move. Let's go.

41:23.355 --> 41:24.607
Hey, what about the laptop?

41:25.441 --> 41:27.067
Can you at least tell us about that?

41:27.151 --> 41:28.736
[whimpering]

41:31.655 --> 41:33.532
[thunder cracks]

41:36.327 --> 41:38.454
[groaning]

41:40.831 --> 41:42.208
You okay?

41:42.291 --> 41:44.043
My ears hurt so bad.

41:44.126 --> 41:45.211
[Nam-ra breathes heavily]

41:45.294 --> 41:46.128
[Su-hyeok gasps]

41:51.342 --> 41:53.219
-[uniform rips]
-[Su-hyeok grunts]

41:57.598 --> 41:58.474
This should help.

42:08.901 --> 42:10.194
[thunder rumbling]

42:13.739 --> 42:15.366
[water pattering]

42:19.995 --> 42:21.080
It's raining.

42:22.706 --> 42:24.208
It's raining.
[chuckles]

42:28.212 --> 42:29.922
Yes, it's raining!

42:30.005 --> 42:31.340
-[laughs]
-It's pouring!

42:37.555 --> 42:39.306
-[thunder rumbling]
-[Gwi-nam groaning]

42:42.935 --> 42:44.270
[groaning]

42:47.022 --> 42:48.941
[Dae-su laughing]

42:51.610 --> 42:53.153
[satisfied groans]

42:54.113 --> 42:55.573
[both laughing]

42:59.451 --> 43:00.286
[screams]

43:01.287 --> 43:03.956
-Ahh, it's so nice.
-[grunts]

43:06.250 --> 43:07.543
[thunder rumbling]

43:13.090 --> 43:14.133
[sobbing]

43:20.639 --> 43:22.725
[crying]

43:31.233 --> 43:33.110
What the fuck.

43:36.947 --> 43:38.365
[thunder rumbles]

43:41.076 --> 43:43.245
[crying]

43:50.711 --> 43:53.714
[whimpering]

43:57.926 --> 44:00.429
[crying]

44:33.837 --> 44:35.923
[thunder rumbles]

44:38.342 --> 44:39.718
[sighs]

44:40.761 --> 44:41.720
[Nam-ra grunts]

44:49.269 --> 44:51.105
-[thunder rumbles]
-[screams]

44:51.689 --> 44:53.482
[groaning]

44:55.109 --> 44:56.652
[grunting]

44:59.446 --> 45:00.364
[Wu-jin sniffles]

45:02.991 --> 45:03.909
[sniffles]

45:03.992 --> 45:05.119
Joon-yeong.

45:05.994 --> 45:08.122
You know how zombies follow us
if they hear us?

45:08.205 --> 45:11.125
Maybe if we move every time
there's thunder, they won't be able to.

45:12.251 --> 45:14.253
[suspenseful music]

45:24.805 --> 45:26.598
I don't think anyone is coming to save us.

45:29.143 --> 45:32.521
Wouldn't you rather die trying
to get out than die here?

45:33.730 --> 45:35.941
All right then. What do you have in mind?

45:36.024 --> 45:38.694
If we take the back door
of the auditorium to the tennis courts

45:39.695 --> 45:42.448
and then go right through
the English center,

45:42.531 --> 45:43.991
we can get to the mountain.

45:47.536 --> 45:49.538
[tense music]

45:56.837 --> 45:59.214
[thunder rumbling]

46:06.180 --> 46:07.931
If we manage to reach the mountain,

46:08.432 --> 46:10.100
we can make it all the way to Yangdong.

46:11.268 --> 46:13.854
I've been hiking there
a few times before with my dad.

46:13.937 --> 46:14.813
[Wu-jin sighs]

46:16.064 --> 46:18.775
Even still, isn't this suicide?

46:18.859 --> 46:20.986
I'm not going. I'm scared.

46:22.446 --> 46:24.615
What are we gonna do
if the zombies catch us?

46:25.240 --> 46:28.202
[Cheong-san] It's not like anyone
is going to save us if we stay here.

46:28.285 --> 46:30.204
We're the only ones
who can save ourselves.

46:33.957 --> 46:34.833
[sighs]

46:36.877 --> 46:38.170
[thunder rumbles]

46:38.253 --> 46:39.505
Let's go.

46:41.256 --> 46:45.469
If anything goes wrong,
I'll scream and lead the zombies away.

46:46.929 --> 46:48.764
That way none of you will get hurt, okay?

46:49.932 --> 46:50.849
So let's do this.

46:51.558 --> 46:52.935
[Su-hyeok] Don't say that.

46:56.480 --> 46:57.773
We're all gonna make it.

47:00.108 --> 47:01.485
If anyone has to die tonight,

47:02.819 --> 47:03.779
it will be me.

47:04.571 --> 47:07.699
Because of the rain,
all the scents came to me at once.

47:07.783 --> 47:08.909
They got mixed up.

47:11.078 --> 47:12.496
The rain is really loud too.

47:16.041 --> 47:18.126
I'm sure the zombies' senses are dulled.

47:18.210 --> 47:20.754
If that's what a half-bie says,
it should be reliable.

47:20.837 --> 47:22.297
What's a half-bie?

47:22.881 --> 47:23.757
A half zomb…

47:26.510 --> 47:28.053
someone you can rely on.

47:29.388 --> 47:30.389
You guys ready?

47:31.431 --> 47:33.183
Nam-ra is strong. She'll keep up.

47:33.725 --> 47:35.269
Let's take her word and go.

47:35.352 --> 47:36.979
I'm not strong right now.

47:37.062 --> 47:37.980
Why not?

47:40.023 --> 47:41.483
I don't know.

47:46.029 --> 47:48.407
I think some of us
might not be able to keep pace.

47:48.490 --> 47:51.493
We can't have anyone fall behind,
let's pair up and hold hands.

47:51.577 --> 47:52.494
For protection.

47:53.245 --> 47:54.246
Okay!

47:55.455 --> 47:56.748
Hey.

48:09.970 --> 48:10.971
[gasps]

48:13.307 --> 48:15.601
-Wu-jin. Let's go.
-Okay.

48:20.772 --> 48:21.648
Hey.

48:23.775 --> 48:24.901
Stay close behind me.

48:26.945 --> 48:28.488
[thunder cracks]

48:29.281 --> 48:30.324
Let's survive tonight.

48:31.533 --> 48:32.951
We'll talk about us later.

48:46.798 --> 48:47.966
Okay!

48:48.050 --> 48:49.134
[hisses]

48:49.217 --> 48:50.802
[door squeaks open]

48:52.262 --> 48:53.472
[Cheong-san breathes heavily]

49:06.068 --> 49:07.194
[zombie growling in distance]

49:09.154 --> 49:10.864
-[Hyo-ryeong] Careful. Careful.
-[Joon-yeong] Okay.

49:10.947 --> 49:12.324
[thunder rumbles]

49:12.407 --> 49:13.909
[Cheong-san] Don't let go of my hand.

49:23.794 --> 49:24.878
[Dae-su whispers]
Okay.

49:38.141 --> 49:39.184
[thunder rumbles]

49:39.267 --> 49:40.268
[gasps]

49:42.604 --> 49:43.939
-[door shuts]
-Damn it!

49:47.442 --> 49:49.903
[Hyo-ryeong shushes]
What are you doing?

49:49.986 --> 49:50.987
[Dae-su] My bad. My bad.

49:53.573 --> 49:55.075
-[Cheong-san] Are you okay?
-Yeah.

49:55.158 --> 49:56.284
[Cheong-san] We trust you.

49:56.993 --> 49:58.662
[Cheong-san breathes heavily]

50:00.497 --> 50:02.249
[Wu-jin shushes]
Be careful.

50:02.332 --> 50:03.417
[thunder rumbles]

50:05.711 --> 50:06.670
[Ji-min] Careful.

50:20.684 --> 50:22.394
[rapid footsteps]

50:26.815 --> 50:28.191
[Cheong-san gasps]

50:30.277 --> 50:31.611
-[Su-hyeok] What's wrong?
-[On-jo] Hold on.

50:31.695 --> 50:33.488
[zombies growling]

50:35.824 --> 50:37.117
[Su-hyeok] Can you see them?

50:38.160 --> 50:39.828
[all breathing heavily]

50:40.746 --> 50:42.330
-[thunder cracks]
-[growling]

50:46.960 --> 50:48.962
[suspenseful music]

50:50.338 --> 50:51.381
[On-jo] It's gone.

50:55.844 --> 50:57.345
[zombies growling in distance]

51:01.767 --> 51:03.226
-[wood clatters]
-[Joon-yeong grunts]

51:05.937 --> 51:06.855
[growls]

51:08.857 --> 51:10.108
[Cheong-san] Ready?

51:11.151 --> 51:12.110
Let's go.

51:15.697 --> 51:17.032
[thunder rumbles]

51:17.699 --> 51:18.700
[puffing]

51:19.367 --> 51:22.120
-[thunder rumbles]
-[zombies growling]

51:22.204 --> 51:23.205
Hey.

51:23.872 --> 51:24.873
They look so weird.

51:24.956 --> 51:25.999
Can you just be quiet now?

51:26.082 --> 51:28.168
[Mi-jin] Hey, come here and look.
Come here and look.

51:28.251 --> 51:29.753
They look like total morons.

51:30.420 --> 51:32.130
Hey.
[sniffs]

51:32.214 --> 51:34.132
I'm seriously freezing.

51:35.175 --> 51:36.510
It must be the rain.

51:36.593 --> 51:38.094
Hey, let's go.

51:38.178 --> 51:39.721
[Mi-jin] It's our best chance to escape.

51:39.805 --> 51:42.224
Let's go behind that building
and head up the mountain.

51:42.307 --> 51:43.558
[thunder cracks]

51:43.642 --> 51:44.559
[objects clatter]

51:45.811 --> 51:47.604
[zombies growling in distance]

51:53.485 --> 51:56.321
-[thunder cracks]
-[zombie growling]

52:04.287 --> 52:07.290
[thunder rumbles]

52:07.374 --> 52:08.542
[zombie growls]

52:13.839 --> 52:15.882
-[wood clatters]
-[Joon-yeong grunts]

52:15.966 --> 52:17.342
[zombie growling]

52:18.385 --> 52:20.262
[zombie growling]

52:22.055 --> 52:23.765
[panting]

52:28.478 --> 52:31.731
I'll lure that zombie
and go over that way.

52:32.566 --> 52:33.567
Then you run.

52:34.901 --> 52:35.735
No way.

52:36.778 --> 52:38.363
I'll lure that zombie over and you can…

52:38.446 --> 52:39.489
[grunts]

52:42.409 --> 52:46.121
We'll go right along
the wall here and cross over there.

52:46.913 --> 52:48.498
[zombie growling in distance]

52:53.795 --> 52:55.797
[tense music]

53:06.099 --> 53:07.225
[zombie growling in distance]

53:11.021 --> 53:13.440
-[zombie growls]
-[Su-hyeok] Get down. Quiet.

53:13.523 --> 53:15.275
Hey. Stay low.

53:20.989 --> 53:22.657
[whispers] We have to go
along the wall.

53:22.741 --> 53:23.575
Okay.

53:23.658 --> 53:25.076
Go along the wall over there.

53:25.160 --> 53:26.578
-[Dae-su] Why?
-[Ji-min] Back there?

53:27.829 --> 53:29.331
[zombie growling]

53:32.375 --> 53:34.044
[leaves rustling]

53:36.671 --> 53:37.672
[growling]

53:39.549 --> 53:40.634
[thunder cracks]

53:42.844 --> 53:44.638
[thunder rumbling]

53:47.807 --> 53:48.850
[thunder cracks]

53:54.064 --> 53:56.107
[thunder rumbling]

54:03.823 --> 54:05.533
[thunder rumbling]

54:05.617 --> 54:06.743
[Cheong-san panting]

54:10.830 --> 54:11.665
I'll go first.

54:14.250 --> 54:15.460
This way.

54:15.543 --> 54:16.962
[grunting]

54:26.596 --> 54:27.847
Cheong-san.

54:28.640 --> 54:30.642
[mellow music]

54:35.021 --> 54:37.023
[foreboding music]

54:38.024 --> 54:39.985
[thunder rumbling]

54:42.612 --> 54:43.905
[croaking]

54:45.115 --> 54:46.241
Is that you, Mom?

54:48.201 --> 54:49.202
[snarls]

55:00.130 --> 55:02.132
[closing theme music]

58:45.146 --> 58:47.482
ALL CHARACTERS,
LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,

58:47.565 --> 58:49.692
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
